    {
      "name": "prepare_approach",
      "description": "Use when the user says 'Make this repeatable'. Read the source session or explicit notes to prepare a reusable approach. Use the Lore session UUID from ask_lore, not a made-up ID. Add further sessions in sessionIds and the active learnings that captured the session's corrections in learningIds; cite them from the items they support using only ids the response lists under sources. If several tasks occurred, ask which to preserve and pass task. Review source corrections and the final work, preserving the successful sequence. If document is null, draft it from the returned evidence without inventing results. Show a short plain-language preview of what will repeat before save_approach; derive inputs, steps, prerequisites, and checks yourself, and keep IDs and command details internal. Preparing does not save. A limited source requires human review.",
